{"name":"Twinkling Lights","hex":"#fffac1","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"twinkling","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Sparkling intermittently."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of twinkle"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/twinkling"},{"term":"lights","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of light"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The lungs, now chiefly of an animal (being lighter than adjacent parts)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lights"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lights (Ellie Goulding album)","blocks":[{"text":"Lights is the debut studio album by English singer-songwriter Ellie Goulding. It was released on 26 February 2010 by Polydor Records, following the independent issue of its lead single, \"Under the Sheets\", through Neon Gold Records in 2009. Much of the album was recorded in producer Starsmith's home studio in Bromley, Essex, with additional contributions from producers including Frankmusik and Fraser T. Smith."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b9/Ellie_Goulding_-_Lights_%28album%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lights_(Ellie_Goulding_album)"},{"title":"Twinkling","blocks":[{"text":"Twinkling, also called scintillation, is a generic term for variations in apparent brightness, colour, or position of a distant luminous object viewed through a medium. If the object lies outside the Earth's atmosphere, as in the case of stars and planets, the phenomenon is termed astronomical scintillation; for objects within the atmosphere, the phenomenon is termed terrestrial scintillation. As one of the three principal factors governing astronomical seeing, atmospheric scintillation is defined as variations in illuminance only."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Szintillation.Sirius.480.webm/330px--Szintillation.Sirius.480.webm.jpg","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Twinkling"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/34/Ellie_Goulding_-_Lights_%28US_edition%29.png/250px-Ellie_Goulding_-_Lights_%28US_edition%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/34/Ellie_Goulding_-_Lights_%28US_edition%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/34/Ellie_Goulding_-_Lights_%28US_edition%29.png/250px-Ellie_Goulding_-_Lights_%28US_edition%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEllie_Goulding_-_Lights_(US_edition).png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Ellie_Goulding.jpg/330px-Ellie_Goulding.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Ellie_Goulding.jpg/330px-Ellie_Goulding.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Goulding in 2009","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEllie_Goulding.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Ellie_Goulding_in_Seattle.jpg/500px-Ellie_Goulding_in_Seattle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Ellie_Goulding_in_Seattle.jpg/1280px-Ellie_Goulding_in_Seattle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Ellie_Goulding_in_Seattle.jpg/500px-Ellie_Goulding_in_Seattle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Goulding performing in Seattle on 11 April 2011","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEllie_Goulding_in_S